<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh forex market closed for bank holiday.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh forex market closed for bank holiday.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's foreign exchange market was closed on Tuesday for a bank holiday marking the beginning of the 1997/98 fiscal year. The Bangladesh taka was quoted at 43.7400/7450 to the dollar in interbank trading on Monday against the previous close at 43.7400/7480.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
</text>
